      "tier": "tooltip",
      "text": "Nocturne darkens the map, reducing the sight radius of all enemy champions and removing their vision of allies for 6 seconds. Nocturne can Recast this Ability during the duration to launch himself at an enemy champion dealing (150/275/400 + (120% bonus Attack Damage)) physical damage.",
